---
// Pricing.astro - Seção de Planos e Modalidades de Contratação B2B
---

<section id="planos" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20">
        Modalidades de Parceria • SaaSCore Sistemas
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Planos SGEMH Dimensionados para a sua Instituição
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-300">
        Gestão Eletrônica de Engenharia Clínica e Gestão de Ativos flexível para clínicas, hospitais gerais e grandes redes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid de Planos -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      
      <!-- Plano 1: Clínico / Pequeno Porte -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-8 transition-all hover:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-900/70">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Clinical Essential</h3>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300">Até 150 ativos</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Ideal para clínicas de imagem, hemodiálise, centros cirúrgicos ambulatoriais e hospitais dia.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline text-white">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">Sob Medida</span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-400">/contrato mensal</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Inventário técnico com etiquetagem QR Code</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Calibração anual dos equipamentos críticos</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Gestão preventiva e corretiva digital</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Suporte técnico em horário comercial</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800">
          <a
            href="#contato"
            class="block w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 py-3 text-center text-xs font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600"
          >
            Consultar Plano Essential
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Plano 2: Enterprise Hospitalar (Destaque) -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border-2 border-cyan-500 bg-slate-900/90 p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-500/10 lg:-translate-y-2">
        <!-- Badge Mais Recomendado -->
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 px-4 py-1 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950 shadow-md">
          Mais Adotado por Hospitais
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Hospital Enterprise</h3>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300">150 a 1.000 ativos</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Gestão completa de engenharia clínica com cobertura para UTI, Centro Cirúrgico e Emergência.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline text-white">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">Personalizado</span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-400">/com SLA garantido</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Tudo do plano Essential</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Metrologia e calibrações com rastreabilidade RBC</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Dossiês de conformidade para Acreditação ONA/JCI</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>SLA de atendimento corretivo emergencial 24/7</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Treinamento continuado de operadores e enfermagem</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800">
          <a
            href="#contato"
            class="block w-full rounded-xl bg-cyan-500 py-3.5 text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/25 transition hover:bg-cyan-400 hover:shadow-cyan-500/40"
          >
            Solicitar Proposta Enterprise
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Plano 3: Redes & Complexos de Saúde -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-8 transition-all hover:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-900/70">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Network & Complex</h3>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-300">+1.000 ativos</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Para redes hospitalares, fundações e complexos de saúde com múltiplas unidades e operações distribuídas.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline text-white">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-blue-400">Customizado</span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-400">/governança integrada</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Equipe de Engenharia Clínica residente in loco</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Gestão centralizada de contratos de terceiros e fabricantes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Integração de dados via API com Tasy, MV Soul ou MV2000</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Comitê executivo mensal de indicadores e redução de custos</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800">
          <a
            href="#contato"
            class="block w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 py-3 text-center text-xs font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600"
          >
            Falar com Consultor de Redes
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
